 private Object js(String code)throws Exception{CountDownLatch latch=new CountDownLatch(1);String[] out={null};runOnMainSync(()->web.evaluateJavascript(code,v->{out[0]=v;latch.countDown();}));if(!latch.await(10,TimeUnit.SECONDS))throw new Exception("JavaScript response timed out");return new JSONTokener(out[0]).nextValue();}
